F][/dim]Areas` catalog that stays correct through `bob areas sync` and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]nightly, always sits above `## Projects`, is protected from [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]capture, turns the \"areas parent only areas\" convention into [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]checked findings, and renders as a calm, colored map card in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Obsidian while staying readable as plain Markdown everywhere else.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]areas_catalog.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/areas_catalog.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ln[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ln/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared catalog engine - AREAS spec, placement order, heading [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]adoption, capture guard[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]catalog-engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog-engine: add the AREAS region spec and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]AfterSectionThenFirstH2 placement, move PROJECTS below an existing Areas[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section, teach every catalog to adopt an authored heading instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]duplicating it, and refuse capture into `## Areas`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Area graph and pure catalog planner[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]areas-graph[dim] · [dim][/dim]after catalog-engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]areas-graph: retain the root note's bytes in the vault snapshot, build [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the validated area graph (root rule, parent findings, cycles), and plan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]nested callout rows per host with golden tests on the real vault shape.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob areas list and check[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]areas-report[dim] · [dim][/dim]after areas-graph[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]areas-report: ship the read-only `bob areas` noun with list/check, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]versioned JSON report (hues, project and Today rollups, catalogs, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]findings), a colored tree view, registration everywhere commands are [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]listed, and the docs/areas.md contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob areas sync, nightly step, and Highlights coverage[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]areas-sync[dim] · [dim][/dim]after areas-report[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]areas-sync: add the guarded `bob areas sync` writer and dry run, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]nightly step before projects, the Highlights regression test, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]integration tests, sync docs, and a read-only preview against the real [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-ledger-tools Areas card shell[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]areas-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after areas-report[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]areas-card: in bob-plugins, add the display-only `[!areas]` card - [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]report service, Reading and Live Preview painting, family chrome, hue [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dots, health line with sync and retry, and the root card's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unplaced-